steps.prompt:
PR activity (reviews, comments, checks, merge state):

{{pr-wait.output}}

Handle the new comments and the failing checks (details via `gh pr view <url> --json statusCheckRollup` if needed). If mergeable is CONFLICTING, update the branch by merging main (merge commit, never a rebase and never a force-push). Tolerate duplicates (at-least-once delivery). If the payload is an idle timeout or a MERGED/CLOSED state, report it without changing anything. End with send_message severity success and a summary of the intervention.
